    "long_instructions": "#### AI is being used everywhere! Let's learn more about what sort of impact that will have on other fields.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n    <summary style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;\">📝 Key Points from the Video</summary>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;\">\r\n    <p>\r\n\r\n#### AI is impacting the following fields...\r\n* #### Education: AI can function as an equalizer, potentially reducing disparities in learning opportunities and resources.\r\n* #### Healthcare: In the medical field, AI is being leveraged to develop new drugs and improve diagnostics, enhancing patient care.\r\n* #### Science and Technology: AI assists in advancing scientific research and technology development, speeding up innovations.\r\n\r\n#### While AI offers considerable benefits, it is crucial to consider the associated risks and consequences of its deployment, ensuring responsible and ethical use.\r\n\r\n</p></div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n"
